{#
| Variable      | Type   | Description                                                      |
|---------------|--------|------------------------------------------------------------------|
| items[]       | array  | List of 3 features                                               |
| items[].icon  | string | SallaIcons css class `sicon-*`                                   |
| items[].title | string | Title of the feature                                             |
| items[].text  | string | Subtitle for the feature                                         |
| position      | Int    | Sorting number start from zero                                   |

  «مميزات المتجر» — Salla's built-in section, restyled.

  No artboard draws it. Salla's review of 2026-10-20 asked for "more elements"
  on Home and the owner chose (option a) to offer this platform section in the
  theme's own language instead of upstream Raed's: a warm section panel holding
  white cards, the icon on a disc in the panel's tone — the shapes the stories
  and partner sections already use. Derived under B4/B8; recorded in
  /docs/DERIVED-DECISIONS.md. The fields are the platform's and unchanged.
#}
{% if items|length %}
    <section data-testid="store-home-features" class="s-block features container">
        <div class="s-block__panel">
            <ul class="features__grid" role="list">
                {% for item in items %}
                    <li class="features__item">
                        <span class="features__icon" aria-hidden="true"><i class="{{ item.icon }}"></i></span>
                        <h2 class="features__title">{{ item.title }}</h2>
                        {% if item.text %}
                            <p class="features__text">{{ item.text }}</p>
                        {% endif %}
                    </li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>
{% endif %}
